@startuml
actor Pelanggan
participant "Portal / API" as API
database "PostgreSQL ticketing" as DB
participant "Midtrans Sandbox" as M
Pelanggan -> API: POST orders (session, requestKey, scheduleId, items)
API -> DB: transaction: advisory lock + Schedule FOR UPDATE
API -> DB: baca harga/kuota, create Order PENDING + items
DB --> API: order tersimpan, reserved bertambah
API -> DB: claim Payment.checkoutStartedAt
API -> M: Snap create (server key privat)
M --> API: hosted checkout URL
API --> Pelanggan: order reference/status
Pelanggan -> M: interaksi pembayaran Sandbox
M -> API: POST webhook (signature)
API -> API: verifikasi SHA-512 dan amount/order
API -> M: GET status (Basic auth server)
M --> API: status terpercaya
API -> DB: lock Order FOR UPDATE
alt paid sah dan hold belum habis
 API -> DB: reserved -> sold, Order PAID, Ticket + AuditLog
else late settlement
 API -> DB: PAYMENT_REVIEW, tanpa tiket/kuota baru
else status terminal gagal/expired
 API -> DB: release reserved sekali
end
API --> M: hasil webhook
Pelanggan -> API: GET PDF (session pemilik)
API -> DB: cek ownership + status PAID
API --> Pelanggan: PDF + QR privat
@enduml
